                                "example_id": "a07cddfb-042b-4a4e-93c5-d18fd9894b05",
                                "sense_id": "2c3a712b-d8d7-3605-a087-652c85c0c529",
                                "text": "There were many groups that flourished during the fifties, and rock trivialists love outdoing each other by naming the most obscure songs, groups, and labels they can think of."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "bc387c3a-11e8-4370-b03a-25d2f942e53a",
                                "sense_id": "2c3a712b-d8d7-3605-a087-652c85c0c529",
                                "text": "Walter was a very friendly man and a very intelligent man. He was a good conversationalist and a trivialist. His pockets were stuffed with different trivia that he liked to test the rangers with."
